  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAN-IFRA Media Freedom and Democracy Programme 2016-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality training and mentoring for media owners and editors. WAN-IFRA aims to ensure economically sustainable media companies through strengthening and promoting female leadership. Several female editors and owners from Norway contribute to the mentoring, targeting female employees. WAN-IFRA also develops and shares guidance on dealing with harassment in the media industry.</narrative>
  </description>
